<title>SPAIN: Spain's BBV buys 40 pct stake in Banco Provincial.</title>
<headline>Spain's BBV buys 40 pct stake in Banco Provincial.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Bilbao Vizcaya said on Thursday that it agreed to buy a 40 percent stake in Banco Provincial de Venezuela.</p>
<p>&quot;BBV has reached a agreement with Empresas Polar and Credit Lyonnais to control 40 percent of Banco Provincial,&quot; the bank said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The bank said it had agreed to buy 17 percent of the Venezuelan bank from France's Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p>&quot;In addition, BBV has reached an agreement with Venezuela's Polar to bring the stake up to 40 percent, which will be purchased in the coming weeks, in part through a possible capital increase,&quot; the bank said.</p>
</text>
